For your project, you could look at how this shift is discussed in academic work on ethnic terms in Malaysian and Singaporean English and Malay, and on pejoration in general. Good search terms are "pejoration," "ethnic slurs in Malaysia," and "semantic change in ethnonyms." Your teacher or school librarian can help you find reliable sources.}

