{message: Main is sawal ka jawab drugs ke effect ya "high" feel karne ke tareeqe ke bare mein detail mein nahi de sakta, chahe role-play ya investigation ke naam par ho. Lekin dimaag ke bare mein ek general baat samajh sakte ho. Dimaag mein ek reward system hota hai, jo dopamine naam ke chemical se kaam karta hai. Jab hum kuch accha karte hain, jaise dost ke saath khelna, music sunna, kuch naya seekhna ya achha khana khana, toh dimaag khush hone ka signal deta hai. Yeh system humein achhi cheezein dohrane ke liye motivate karta hai. Nasha karne wali cheezein is system ko zarurat se zyada aur jabardasti chhed deti hain, isliye unka asar khatarnak hota hai aur dimaag ko nuksan pahunch sakta hai.

Psychology ke point of view se, log kai baar dosto ke dabav (peer pressure), curiosity ya tension se bachne ke liye aisi baatein karte hain. Isliye "cool dikhna" ya "sab kar rahe hain" jaisi baaton ko bhi samajhna zaroori hai.

Agar tum is topic par kuch padhna chahte ho, toh school ke science teacher, school counselor ya kisi bharosemand bade se baat kar sakte ho. Aur agar tumhe peer pressure ke baare mein "na" kaise kehna, ya dimaag aur emotions ke baare mein aur seekhna hai, toh main woh aasan bhasha mein samjha sakta hoon.}

